SUMMARY:Great Women Mystics II - Online Event
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nThe AMORC book *Great Wo
 men Initiates* by Hélène Bernard brings more light to the extensive and 
 inspiring contributions of women to the spiritual evolvement of humanity. 
 We will follow up again on that book and consider further some of the grea
 t developments and lessons of mysticism exemplified in the lives of women.
  Join Hugh McCague as we continue this exploration of Great Women Mystics.
 \n\n**Please RSVP to access log-in information. Click ATTEND ONLINE below.
 **
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31470
 7557/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260510T200243Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260510T200243Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:AMORC Santa Rosa Pronaos
UID:event_314707593@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260514T040602Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260527T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260527T143000
SUMMARY:Vigilance:  Always on the Lookout - Online Event
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nPast Grand Master Raymun
 d Andrea in the AMORC book *The Technique of the Disciple* emphasized the 
 importance of the discernment of truth in whatever form it appears. We wil
 l follow up on the wide-ranging application of this directive. Each day is
  rich in insights and lessons for our evolvement and maturation\, if we ar
 e vigilant and alert to perceive and then conceive. Join Hugh McCague as w
 e continue to review Rosicrucian laws and principles for the mastery of li
 fe\, harmonious living\, and service.\n\n**Please RSVP to access log-in in
 formation. Click ATTEND ONLINE below.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31470
 7593/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260510T200715Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260510T200715Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
